From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:12:48 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 426/443] [ae-patch] Fix the fix-check findings on 0425: end
 the Send now settle on unmount or chat switch, skip Esc from other controls

The settle timer is cleared and its flags reset when the chat changes or the hook unmounts, and a flush only sends in the chat and Voice mode it started in. Esc from a terminal, editor or button, or with an overlay open, is left to that control instead of discarding the take.
